// ==UserScript==
// @name         RO Plugin v3 — StorageWithdrawSets
// @namespace    robrowser
// @version      1.0.0
// @description  /withdraw opens a window of named crafting sets — a textarea of lines per craft like '2 Frill', 'Red Gemstone x1' or an item id ; a line with no count (a Creation Guide) is held once, never multiplied. Each set has a ×1 / ×10 / ×20 / ×50 choice. Withdraw counts what the inventory already holds, takes the rest from the cart then the personal storage, and when the stock falls short prepares the max makeable. The storage is opened only when needed (@storage when the « @storage available » box is ticked, else or if it does not open the nearest Kafra in sight), its withdraws go first and it is closed before any cart move (rAthena ignores cart moves while a storage is open). Red chat lines name the items that cap the count and any refused request ; one white line gives the crafts ready. /withdraw <set> [N] runs without the window. Presets: Alchemist (one Twilight Alchemy 3 cast), Poison Bottle, Fireproof / Coldproof / Earthproof / Thunderproof Potion. Sets are saved per account ; the guild storage is refused.
// @match        *://*.cyro.live/*
// @match        *://cyro.live/*
// @run-at       document-start
// @grant        unsafeWindow
// @updateURL    https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/meitogi/ro-plugins@main/storage-withdraw-sets/1.0.0/storage-withdraw-sets.user.js
// @downloadURL  https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/meitogi/ro-plugins@main/storage-withdraw-sets/1.0.0/storage-withdraw-sets.user.js
// ==/UserScript==

